    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/1952fa3265ee87cc522fba6b65745408.poster.avif?t=1719861579\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/1952fa3265ee87cc522fba6b65745408.webm?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/1952fa3265ee87cc522fba6b65745408.mp4?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/8003bef3b6910c770052c4a9b9f31ed0.poster.avif?t=1719861579\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/8003bef3b6910c770052c4a9b9f31ed0.webm?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/8003bef3b6910c770052c4a9b9f31ed0.mp4?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/838c8e705175232e40e33b61985fa637.poster.avif?t=1719861579\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/838c8e705175232e40e33b61985fa637.webm?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/838c8e705175232e40e33b61985fa637.mp4?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Power Quest Survivors is a fantasy roguelike bullet hell game with a dash of action RPG.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your class</h2>Knight, Archer, Mage.<br>Each class comes with its own mastery trees, offering unique abilities to beef up your character.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Defeat enemies, gain experience, unlock new abilities, and strengthen your character as you progress through each level. Stay alive for as long as you can!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try demo by joining playtest</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/65a2582c9872ba29d1ecc4cc1f1cac08.poster.avif?t=1719861579\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/65a2582c9872ba29d1ecc4cc1f1cac08.webm?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/65a2582c9872ba29d1ecc4cc1f1cac08.mp4?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Your foes in the demo playtest</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skeleton melee: They're fast and they come in hordes. They'll break your armor on hit.<br></li><li>Skeleton ranged: Fragile but tricky to hit, they deal hefty physical damage and slow you down.<br></li><li>Skeleton shaman: Fragile but packs a punch with magical attacks. Watch out for their long-lasting slow-moving spell and their fast, tracking attack that zeroes in on you.<br></li><li>Skeleton giant (boss): These big guys only show up when you've racked up enough kills. They're tough, with area-of-effect and stun attacks.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist to see more of it &lt;3</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/5c85c1ebc94a34d5394e89e1d7f76848.poster.avif?t=1719861579\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/5c85c1ebc94a34d5394e89e1d7f76848.webm?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714020/extras/5c85c1ebc94a34d5394e89e1d7f76848.mp4?t=1719861579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for more (dev blog, community) ? Find me on Discord</h2>",
